==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gml|de}} {{m|gml|krabbe}}. Cognate with {{etyl|nl|-}} {{m|nl|krab}}, {{etyl|en|-}} {{m|nl|crab}}, {{etyl|non|-}} {{m|non|krabbi}}. Further origin unknown; possibly from a [[substrate]] language. Compare {{etyl|la|-}} {{m|la|carabus}}.

